routing.craft-agent-instruction-writer:
# AGENTS

When an instruction is precise but a human maintainer cannot follow it:
  @Plain Language Explainer, please rewrite the explanation without loosening the instruction.

routing.craft-article-shaper:
# AGENTS

When a block is correct but keeps losing readers:
  @Plain Language Explainer, please re-pitch it and say which part is still most likely to be missed.

routing.craft-beat-sequencer:
# AGENTS

When a beat lands for the writer and not for anyone else:
  @Plain Language Explainer, please re-pitch it in the agreed words and keep the move intact.

routing.craft-fragment-miner:
# AGENTS

When the pile is rich enough and the piece has an argument to carry:
  @Article Shaper, please settle the prerequisites, then offer the openings.
When the pile is rich enough and the piece reads more like a journey than an argument:
  @Beat Sequencer, please offer the opening beats and let the writer choose the way in.

routing.craft-plain-language-explainer:
# AGENTS

When the clearer wording changes what the surrounding blocks need to do:
  @Article Shaper, please re-thread the blocks either side of it.
